{"seq":3,"slug":"llm-as-judge","title":"LLM 作为裁判","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/eval-driven-ai-engineering/building-evals/llm-as-judge","wordCount":1568,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"llm-作为裁判\">LLM 作为裁判</h1><p>让一个大模型去给另一个大模型的回答打分，听起来像是把不靠谱交给不靠谱，但它确实是 2026 年评测开放式输出最强的手段——前提是你承认裁判会犯一类很特定的、可测量的、可校准的错误。一个未经校准的 LLM 裁判会系统性地偏爱排在前面的答案、偏爱更长的答案、偏爱和它自己风格相近的答案。这些偏差不是随机噪声，而是有方向的系统偏移，会稳定地把你的分数推向错误的方向。本篇讲这些偏差怎么来、怎么测、怎么校准到能信。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LLM-as-judge 是用一个大模型按预设的评分量规（rubric），对被测系统的输出给出分数或偏好判断。它的吸引力在于能评估确定性指标和语义指标都够不着的主观质量；它的风险在于裁判本身是个有系统偏差的测量仪器，原始分数未经校准不能直接跨实验、跨时间比较，因为它会漂移（<a href=\"https://deepchecks.com/llm-judge-calibration-automated-issues/\">Deepchecks, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[被测输出] --&gt; B[LLM 裁判 + 评分量规]&#10;    B --&gt; C[原始分数或偏好]&#10;    C --&gt; D{校准过吗}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[受偏差污染不可信]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[与人工标注对齐 85-90%]&#10;    F --&gt; G[可用于回归门与对比]&#10;    E --&gt; H[需先做偏差校准]&#10;    H --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    A[被测输出] --&gt; B[LLM 裁判 + 评分量规]\n    B --&gt; C[原始分数或偏好]\n    C --&gt; D{校准过吗}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[受偏差污染不可信]\n    D --&gt;|是| F[与人工标注对齐 85-90%]\n    F --&gt; G[可用于回归门与对比]\n    E --&gt; H[需先做偏差校准]\n    H --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"五种系统性偏差\">五种系统性偏差</h2><p>2026 年的研究把 LLM 裁判的偏差归纳为五类：位置偏好、冗长偏好、自我偏好、格式偏好、校准漂移（<a href=\"https://futureagi.com/blog/evaluating-llm-judge-bias-mitigation-2026/\">FutureAGI, 2026</a>）。理解每一种的方向，才能对症下药。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏差</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>成因</th>\n<th>对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>位置偏好</td>\n<td>偏爱成对比较中排在前面的答案</td>\n<td>注意力与解码顺序效应</td>\n<td>双向提问 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(A,B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(B,A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 取一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冗长偏好</td>\n<td>偏爱更长的回答</td>\n<td>长文本观感更&quot;详尽&quot;</td>\n<td>量规明确&quot;长度不计分&quot;、控制长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自我偏好</td>\n<td>偏爱与裁判同源模型的风格</td>\n<td>裁判认得自己的输出风格</td>\n<td>用不同家族的模型当裁判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式偏好</td>\n<td>偏爱带列表、加粗的排版</td>\n<td>训练偏好对齐的副作用</td>\n<td>量规聚焦内容、剥离格式干扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校准漂移</td>\n<td>同标准随时间打分变化</td>\n<td>裁判模型被供应商升级</td>\n<td>锁定裁判版本、定期重锚定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中位置偏好最被深入研究：成对比较里把同样两个答案交换先后顺序，裁判的结论可能就翻转，研究显示这种顺序敏感能造成约四成的不一致（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2506.22316v1\">arXiv 2506.22316, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校准位置偏好\">校准位置偏好</h2><p>位置偏好的标准对策是<strong>双向提问取一致</strong>：同一对答案，分别以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(A,B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(B,A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 两种顺序各问一次，只有当两次给出一致结论时才记为有效胜负，否则记为平局或弃票。更精细的做法是把两个顺序的分数平均，用对称化抵消方向性偏移。</p>\n<p>设裁判在顺序 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(A,B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 下给 A 的得分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{AB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(B,A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 下给 A 的得分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{BA}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对称化后 A 的稳健得分为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_A = \\frac{s_{AB} + s_{BA}}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>2026 年的研究在此之上提出了更强的方法，比如对预测分布做校准来纠正选择偏差，以及把项目反应理论用到裁判身上、把可靠性当作测量仪器本身的属性来建模（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2410.15393\">arXiv 2410.15393</a>）。对绝大多数工程团队，双向提问加对称化已能消掉大半位置偏好，是性价比最高的起手式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用人工标注对齐裁判\">用人工标注对齐裁判</h2><p>校准了偏差还不够，你得证明这个裁判和人的判断到底有多接近——否则它打的分再稳定也可能稳定地错。做法是准备一份小规模的人工标注参考集（几十到一两百条，由人按同一份量规打分），让裁判也跑一遍，算二者的一致率。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[人工标注参考集] --&gt; B[人按量规打分]&#10;    A --&gt; C[LLM 裁判按同量规打分]&#10;    B --&gt; D[算一致率]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E{达到 85-90%?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[改量规/换裁判/加少样本示例]&#10;    F --&gt; C&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G[裁判可投入回归使用]\">flowchart TD\n    A[人工标注参考集] --&gt; B[人按量规打分]\n    A --&gt; C[LLM 裁判按同量规打分]\n    B --&gt; D[算一致率]\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E{达到 85-90%?}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[改量规/换裁判/加少样本示例]\n    F --&gt; C\n    E --&gt;|是| G[裁判可投入回归使用]</pre><p>2026 年的工程基准是把裁判校准到与人工标注参考集达成八成五到九成的一致（<a href=\"https://futureagi.com/blog/llm-evaluation-frameworks-metrics-best-practices/\">FutureAGI, 2026</a>）。没达到就回去改进：把评分量规写得更具体可操作、在提示里塞入几条已打分的少样本示例锚定标准、或者换一个能力更强的裁判模型。一致率这个数字本身也要随裁判版本升级而重测，因为校准漂移会让昨天对齐的裁判今天偏移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"量规设计-裁判的灵魂\">量规设计：裁判的灵魂</h2><p>裁判的质量上限由评分量规决定。模糊的量规（&quot;评价这个回答好不好，1 到 5 分&quot;）会让裁判凭感觉打分，偏差全开。好量规把抽象质量拆成可操作的具体维度：是否准确回答了问题、是否忠实于给定上下文没有编造、是否完整覆盖了要点、语气是否得体，每个维度给明确的打分锚点。G-Eval 这类框架更进一步，让裁判先用思维链生成评分步骤再逐步打分，把&quot;凭感觉&quot;变成&quot;按流程&quot;，显著提升一致性。</p>\n<p>需要划清边界：本篇只讲裁判这一种打分方式的偏差与校准。字面层和语义层指标、以及怎么把裁判和确定性检查组合成&quot;先门后分&quot;的打分器，是上一篇的内容（见 <a href=\"metrics-scoring\">指标与打分</a>）；裁判用在多步 Agent 评测里的特殊形态（按轨迹打分），见 <a href=\"../practice/agent-eval\">Agent 评测</a>；裁判被恶意输入钻空子、以及裁判漂移的长期追踪，分别见 <a href=\"../practice/pitfalls-leakage\">陷阱与数据泄漏</a> 和 <a href=\"../in-project/versioning-tracking\">版本与追踪</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LLM-as-judge 是评开放式主观质量的最强手段，但裁判是有系统偏差的测量仪器，原始分未校准不可跨实验跨时间比较。</li>\n<li>裁判有五类系统偏差：位置、冗长、自我、格式、校准漂移，每类方向明确、各有对策。</li>\n<li>位置偏好最显著（约四成不一致），标准对策是双向提问取一致、分数对称化平均。</li>\n<li>必须用小规模人工标注参考集验证裁判一致率，工程基准是对齐到八成五到九成，未达标就改量规、加少样本、换裁判。</li>\n<li>量规设计决定裁判质量上限：把抽象质量拆成可操作维度并给打分锚点，G-Eval 式思维链评分能进一步提升一致性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LLM 作为裁判","id":"llm-作为裁判"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"五种系统性偏差","id":"五种系统性偏差"},{"level":2,"text":"校准位置偏好","id":"校准位置偏好"},{"level":2,"text":"用人工标注对齐裁判","id":"用人工标注对齐裁判"},{"level":2,"text":"量规设计：裁判的灵魂","id":"量规设计-裁判的灵魂"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"指标与打分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/eval-driven-ai-engineering/building-evals/metrics-scoring"},"next":{"title":"评测框架落地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/eval-driven-ai-engineering/in-project/eval-harness-setup"}}